		: your (#bike) locked to a piece of machinery, your (#backpack) looped over the handlebars.
	(else)
		, with your (#bike) locked to a convenient piece of (zlink {machinery}) .
	(endif)

(from * go #south to #realcamp) ~(real camp explained)
(from * go #northeast to #nabiyunus)
(from * go #east to #abovedig)

#bike
(name *) bicycle
(dict *) bike handlebar handlebars handle bar bars handles
(your *)
